#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:5
#: e963aa00c97b45bc856d60fdf1914920
msgid "Brushed Motors"
msgstr "有刷电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:7
#: 008500f5857645c581b273e0ba06c5e9
msgid "ArduPilot supports multiple methods to control brushed motors"
msgstr "ArduPilot支持多种控制有刷电机的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:9
#: 25d025f104684a8085e696f9100cd93b
msgid ""
"Brushed motor ESCs that support RC PWM input (PWM signals that are 1ms to "
"2ms in width) are the easiest to use because no special configuration is "
"required and the rest of this document can be ignored.  Most hobby grade RC "
"Car ESCs are of this type"
msgstr ""
"支持RC PWM输入（脉冲宽度1ms至2ms）的有刷电机ESC使用最为简便，无需特殊配置，本文档其余内容可忽略。大多数遥控车用ESC属于此类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:12
#: 446ff4c1508648328ef71161aea069f4
msgid ""
"\"Brushed With Relay\" motor drivers accept a duty cycle to control the "
"speed and also have a separate pin used to control direction"
msgstr "「带继电器的有刷」电机驱动器接受占空比来控制速度，同时有一个独立引脚用于控制方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:13
#: f9ea9b65a9c0442e891a20499969d0be
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"\"Brushed BiPolar\" motor drivers accept a duty cycle where 0% duty cycle "
"means full speed in one direction, 100% duty cycle is full speed in the "
"other direction and 50% duty cycle is stopped"
msgstr "「有刷双极」电机驱动器接受占空比，其中 0% 占空比表示一个方向全速，100% 占空比表示另一个方向全速，50% 占空比表示停止"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:17
#: 96a0b4311dea49c38708a4f38201f2e5
msgid "Verified Motor Drivers"
msgstr "已验证的电机驱动器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:19
#: 7847c6a137e847638679b8ff34f84559
msgid ""
"`Sabertooth Dual 32A Motor Driver  "
"<https://www.dimensionengineering.com/products/sabertooth2x32>`__ supports "
"\"Normal\" when the Sabertooth is in RC Mode"
msgstr ""
"`Sabertooth双路32A电机驱动器 "
"<https://www.dimensionengineering.com/products/sabertooth2x32>`__ "
"在Sabertooth处于RC模式时支持 「Normal」 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:20
#: cf3241faa55644759fc4c4d104354dcb
msgid ""
"`Pololu G2 High-Power Motor Driver <https://www.pololu.com/product/2991>`__ "
"supports \"BrushedWithRelay\""
msgstr ""
"`Pololu G2高功率电机驱动器 <https://www.pololu.com/product/2991>`__ 支持 "
"「BrushedWithRelay」 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:21
#: 86972fdfe5c14f24b07d6a59f7048194
msgid ""
"`Pololu DRV8838 Motor Driver <https://www.pololu.com/product/2990>`__ "
"supports \"BrushedWithRelay\""
msgstr ""
"`Pololu DRV8838电机驱动器 <https://www.pololu.com/product/2990>`__ 支持 "
"「BrushedWithRelay」 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:22
#: bbec62d589b04cc8bb0a1d35cbd2537d
msgid ""
"`RoboClaw 2x7A Motor Controller <https://www.pololu.com/product/3284>`__ "
"supports \"Normal\" when the Roboclaw is in RC Mode"
msgstr ""
"`RoboClaw 2x7A电机控制器 <https://www.pololu.com/product/3284>`__ "
"在Roboclaw处于RC模式时支持 「Normal」 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:23
#: 404cbb3004344884bc6630d9224084e5
msgid ""
"`L298N Motor Driver <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=l298n+motor+driver>`__ - see"
" :ref:`configuration note below<l298n_note>`."
msgstr ""
"`L298N电机驱动器 <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=l298n+motor+driver>`__ - 参见 "
":ref:`下方配置说明<l298n_note>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:24
#: dc7d6d369a754ac49ef31aca7df1a4da
msgid ":ref:`SkyRocket <copter:skyrocket>` drones use \"Brushed\" motors"
msgstr ":ref:`SkyRocket <copter:skyrocket>` 无人机使用 「有刷」 电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:27
#: 01da8d244571493ab8de763fe793a983
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:29
#: 2ec5c854e5b242dba529dbd8caf85385
msgid ""
"Connect the motor drivers / ESCs to the autopilot's output pins just as you "
"would for regular brushless ESCs but note the warning at the bottom "
"regarding mixing brushed outputs with servos"
msgstr "将电机驱动器/ESC连接至飞控的输出引脚，方式与普通无刷ESC相同，但请注意底部关于有刷输出与舵机混用的警告。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:33
#: 14e69ca1232f43bdb2a84cfcb4d67446
msgid ""
"If using \"Brushed with Relay\" connect the :ref:`Relay <common-relay>` "
"pin(s) to the motor driver's direction pin(s)."
msgstr "如果使用「带继电器的有刷」，请将 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>` 引脚连接到电机驱动器的方向引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:34
#: 79a9a986ee08460c997610e2ce62ac10
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` = 3 for \"BrushedWithRelay\" or \"4\""
" for \"BrushedBIPolar\" and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 设置为 3（BrushedWithRelay）或 "
"4（BrushedBIPolar），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:35
#: 898ace54a0c74f24943bcd9ebdbcbe1e
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_PWM_FREQ <MOT_PWM_FREQ>` defaults to 16000 but can be changed to "
"any value from 1000 to 20000 to change the output frequency"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_PWM_FREQ <MOT_PWM_FREQ>` 默认为 16000，可更改为 1000 到 20000 之间的任意值以调整输出频率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:38
#: 8e6b2651a0674635b2565c87a6d0ec1e
msgid ""
"in some ground control stations, attempting to set MOT_PWM_FREQ above its "
"normal 50 to 490hz range will require the user to acknowledge this \"out of "
"range\" setup in order to set the parameter. This is to prevent accidental "
"misconfiguration for brushless ESCs."
msgstr ""
"在某些地面站中，将MOT_PWM_FREQ设置超出正常50至490Hz范围时，可能需要用户确认此 「超出范围」 "
"设置才能保存参数。这是为了防止无刷ESC的意外错误配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:43
#: de4f6a6ad3694e25ab77df56caa7bf50
msgid ""
"If the autopilot will also control servos (which use regular RC PWM) take "
"care that the servos are not in the same \"PWM output group\" as any motor "
"outputs.  The grouping is only documented on some of the :ref:`AutoPilot "
"Hardware Options <common-autopilots>` pages but for a regular Pixhawk or "
"Cube autopilot MAIN OUT 1 ~ 4 are in group1 meaning that if any brushed "
"motors are configured for MAIN OUT 1 to 4 then servos must be connected to "
"output 5 or higher"
msgstr ""
"若飞控还需控制舵机（使用普通RC PWM），请确保舵机与电机输出不在同一「PWM输出组」中。部分 :ref:`飞控硬件选项 <common-"
"autopilots>` 页面有组划分说明，对于普通Pixhawk或Cube飞控，MAIN OUT 1至4在第1组，因此若有刷电机配置在MAIN OUT"
" 1至4，则舵机必须连接至输出5或更高编号的输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:47
#: 67ba077c11754b5a9e427d3dc5259cc1
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support controlling both brushed and brushless "
"**motors** at the same time"
msgstr "ArduPilot目前不支持同时控制有刷和无刷 **电机**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:54
#: f5dc749b0b9640bbae206ead08031ae3
msgid ""
"If using \"Brushed with Relay\" to control an L298N motor driver, two relay "
"outputs are required for each motor, one of which must be inverted."
msgstr "若使用 「Brushed with Relay」 控制L298N电机驱动器，每个电机需要两路继电器输出，其中一路必须反相。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:56
#: 181b4c7491cd4665ae5390f519f0bf08
msgid "Set the following servo parameters:"
msgstr "设置以下舵机参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:58
#: 057dfd6542ef4cd98b1be140c164524c
msgid ":ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` = 3"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` = 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:59
#: 3b18d4336b814474805cf88039b5b30f
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 73 (\"ThrottleLeft\" or 70 for "
"\"Throttle\")"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 73（「ThrottleLeft」 或 70 代表 "
"「Throttle」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:60
#: 3d512c63e88a454ebf304735e5c95303
msgid ":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION<SERVO3_FUNCTION>` = 74 (\"ThrottleRight\" or unused)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION<SERVO3_FUNCTION>` = 74（「ThrottleRight」 或不使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:62
#: 2f0d29ebec3b498c9e24b87c24d54c51
msgid "Then configure the relays:"
msgstr "然后配置继电器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:64
#: ac4c54f3fcd940629b53089eb83578ce
msgid ":ref:`RELAY1_FUNCTION<RELAY1_FUNCTION>` = 5 (connect to IN1)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY1_FUNCTION<RELAY1_FUNCTION>` = 5（连接至IN1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:65
#: 13eb98cab60f4ee6b36988ea0d9ae977
msgid ":ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` = 50 (Pixhawk/Cube AUX1)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY1_PIN<RELAY1_PIN>` = 50（Pixhawk/Cube AUX1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:66
#: 2401ac70624a491e9e296f8e9f3b9244
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_FUNCTION<RELAY2_FUNCTION>` = 5 (connect to IN2)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_FUNCTION<RELAY2_FUNCTION>` = 5（连接至IN2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:67
#: 38a07585e5fa4cfcb0d22991348490f5
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = 51 (AUX2)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = 51（AUX2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:68
#: bce7d9b422ee494fbe1ab32c91bdf519
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_INVERTED<RELAY2_INVERTED>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_INVERTED<RELAY2_INVERTED>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:70
#: 3f509875080549a2be84ca8b7314048a
msgid "Additionally, if using \"ThrottleRight\" (74):"
msgstr "此外，若使用 「ThrottleRight」（74）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:72
#: b8bc1062e9274c2d8f4e3e7b5b96bca0
msgid ":ref:`RELAY3_FUNCTION<RELAY3_FUNCTION>` = 6 (connect to IN3)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY3_FUNCTION<RELAY3_FUNCTION>` = 6（连接至IN3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:73
#: a358c693e9bb48909916d623f1715154
msgid ":ref:`RELAY3_PIN<RELAY3_PIN>` = 52 (AUX3)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY3_PIN<RELAY3_PIN>` = 52（AUX3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:74
#: d9474d4ad7834e5fbd95d33c211622b7
msgid ":ref:`RELAY4_FUNCTION<RELAY4_FUNCTION>` = 6 (connect to IN4)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY4_FUNCTION<RELAY4_FUNCTION>` = 6（连接至IN4）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:75
#: 1c8fe92a6ac848fa94a0c7986c459ae2
msgid ":ref:`RELAY4_PIN<RELAY4_PIN>` = 53 (AUX4)"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY4_PIN<RELAY4_PIN>` = 53（AUX4）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:76
#: a246f3605e2a453b9027f4b4b557f82b
msgid ":ref:`RELAY4_INVERTED<RELAY4_INVERTED>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY4_INVERTED<RELAY4_INVERTED>` = 1"

